{"id":"khitryj","lemma":"хитрый","pos":"adj","rank":4581,"glosses":["sly, cunning, artful","intricate, involved","skilful, resourceful"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/dd/Ru-%D1%85%D0%B8%D1%82%D1%80%D1%8B%D0%B9.ogg/Ru-%D1%85%D0%B8%D1%82%D1%80%D1%8B%D0%B9.ogg.mp3","forms":{"comparative":"хитрее","neuter":"хитрое","feminine":"хитрая","plural":"хитрые"},"examples":[{"text":"Он хитрая лиса.","en":"He is a sly fox.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},null,{"g":"fox"}]},{"text":"Какой дьявольски хитрый план!","en":"What a fiendishly clever plan!","words":[{"g":"what, what one"},null,null,{"g":"plan , scheme"}]},{"text":"Мой кот очень хитрый.","en":"My cat's really sneaky.","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"tomcat"},{"g":"very"},null]},{"text":"Говорят, что лиса хитрее любого другого животного.","en":"It is said that the fox is more cunning than any other animal.","words":[{"g":"to speak, to talk","l":"говорить"},{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"fox"},null,null,null,{"g":"animal","l":"животное"}]},{"text":"Я не люблю его, потому что он хитрый как лиса.","en":"I don't like him because he is sly as a fox.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to love","l":"любить"},{"g":"him / his"},null,null,{"g":"he / it"},null,{"g":"how / like"},{"g":"fox"}],"phrases":[[4,6,"because"]]}]}